total_closure_schema
  issue 1138
  purpose "Schema knowledge for distinguishing semantic references from local declaration identities and literal matcher operands in the total-closure audit. The audit retains structural branch-versus-leaf detection; this data supplies the domain vocabulary so new record kinds and matchers are discoverable without Python edits."
  invariant "Only the first value of a declaration head with children is an identity. The same head on a leaf remains a semantic reference. Every value of a literal operand head is matcher syntax rather than a meaning edge."
